Description: Mediation analysis with incomplete data. Fits the mediator and
    outcome regressions on each dataset imputed with 'mice' (through 'medfit'),
    pools them with Rubin's rules, and infers the indirect effect with a Monte
    Carlo confidence interval ('RMediation') or a D4-stacked model-based
    constrained optimization (MBCO) likelihood-ratio test. Also provides an
    inverse probability weighting estimator, treatment-by-mediator interaction
    models, and a delta-adjustment sensitivity analysis for departures from
    missing at random. A deprecated structural equation modeling interface
    ('lavaan', 'OpenMx') remains until version 0.6.0.
